* Edit 3: Transformer-coupled input with center-tapped inductor
* Replace L1+C1 with transformer primary (L4-L5) connected to VIN1
L L4 VIN1 n20
L L5 n20 n1
L L6 n20 VSS  ; Center tap for AC ground
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n3 VSS
L L2 n3 VSS
NMOS NM2 n4 VDD n2 VSS
L L3 VDD n4
C C2 n4 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1